flowchart TB
  U[Users and Developers] --> WEB[Next.js Web App on Vercel]
  U --> API[Versioned FastAPI API]
  WEB --> API
  API --> IAM[Identity, Tenant and Policy]
  IAM --> ORCH[Query and Model Orchestrator]
  ORCH --> PLAN[Hybrid Retrieval Planner]
  PLAN --> OWN[ORIOM7 Owned Index]
  PLAN --> EXT[External Search Adapters]
  OWN --> RANK[Normalise, Deduplicate and Rank]
  EXT --> RANK
  RANK --> ORCH
  ORCH --> MODELS[Multi-Model Provider Adapters]
  MODELS --> HOSTED[Hosted Model Providers]
  MODELS --> SELF[Future Self-hosted Models]
  API --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  API --> REDIS[(Redis)]
  PLAN --> QUEUE[Managed Queue]
  QUEUE --> WORKERS[Ingestion and Index Workers]
  WORKERS --> OBJECT[(Object Storage)]
  WORKERS --> OWN
  ORCH --> OBS[Telemetry and Evaluation]
